# HANDOFF.md

> **Read this first.** It answers: what is this, where does it run, what's the current
> state, and where do I start? Written for a competent stranger (human or AI) who knows
> nothing about the project.
>
> **Keep it current.** A stale handoff is worse than none — it actively misleads. If a
> change makes this file wrong, fix it in the same session.

